<title>USA: Pudgie's Chicken Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Pudgie's Chicken Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended	Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>			 December 31,		December 31,</p>
<p>		    1996	  1995	     1996	   1995</p>
<p> Revenue    2,215,482   2,952,743     11,404,006   11,199,768</p>
<p>Net loss</p>
<p>	  ( 10,628,495) ( 1,313,018)  ( 17,037,257)($4,164,617)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p>		 (  2.37)    (  0.29)	 (  3.80)     (  1.44)</p>
<p>Shares used in</p>
<p>computation</p>
<p>		4,488,385   4,506,973	4,486,404    2,892,182</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said its net loss increase for the current fourth quarter and year end was due to a non-cash charge of about $8.1 million for a write down on assets and $935,298 of bankruptcy related expenses.</p>
<p>The company also said in September 1996 it filed a reorganization petition under Chapter 11 of the Bankruptcy Code.</p>
<p>The full company name is Pudgie's Chicken Inc.</p>
</text>
